WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.640
Can we have the patrol units, particularly west side,
like Lake Mars and areas like that,

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:12.720
just to check boat launches, see if maybe he was
taken back and dropped off in that area,

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:16.880
kind of ride through Lake Mars and other areas,
looking for him.

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:19.960
10-4.

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:33.300
I’m not sure where they looked for him, but if he got
a ride back and got dropped off…

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:39.300
[Follow-up again asks that the area be checked;
several words are unclear.]

00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:42.970
A lot of our units checked the boat ramps
in our area,

00:00:42.970 --> 00:00:50.090
and Pascagoula checked—there’s negative contact
[with the male] at any boat ramps or piers.

00:00:54.090 --> 00:00:56.090
I also contacted Biloxi as well.

00:00:56.090 --> 00:00:57.090
They should be calling back shortly.

00:00:57.090 --> 00:00:59.090
They’re checking their boat [ramps/routes] as well.
